  "preamble": "Loanword adaptation of the English voiceless postalveolar affricate [tʃ] as the Korean aspirated alveolo-palatal affricate ㅊ [tɕʰ]. Korean has no postalveolar affricates, and English voiceless /tʃ/ is matched to the aspirated member of the three-way laryngeal series (lax ㅈ, tense ㅉ, aspirated ㅊ), in all word positions.",
